                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "Today marks 2 years since the 988 Suicide & Crisis Lifeline became available to all Americans. \n\nSince its inception, 988 has provided 24/7, confidential assistance to over 10 million Americans experiencing a mental health crisis. I'm proud to be part of this incredible, bipartisan effort to expand mental health crisis support. \n\nLearn more from @NAMICommunicate: https://t.co/EAlXpOZSrK",
