                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "I enjoyed meeting with the Information Technology and Innovation Foundation this morning to discuss my priorities as a member of the @HouseCommerce Committee. Our discussion was wide ranging and focused on numerous policies, including health care, energy, and telecom. \n\nAs I discussed with the attendees, I\u2019ve been able to work as Chair of the Communications & Technology Subcommittee to increase broadband Internet access, secure our communications networks from cyberattacks, and lead the world in spectrum management. Thank you for having me!",
