                "text": "On National #RuralHealthDay, we recognize all the providers and health care workers who dutifully serve our rural communities. With more than 60 million Americans living in rural communities, we must ensure they have access to quality health care. \n\nAs a member of @HouseCommerce's Health Subcommittee, I'll continue to champion solutions that increase access to care and improve health outcomes for all Americans.",
