                "text": "Now, more than ever, Americans need innovation in health care.\n\nThe Over-the-Counter Monograph Drug User Fee Program brings 100,000+ safe, affordable medicines to market. Reauthorizing this program will drive more medical breakthroughs and expand options for all Americans. https://t.co/fpccD7R34X",
