                "retweet_count": 1,
                "source": "TweetDeck Web App",
                "text": ".@MarchofDimes leads the fight for the health of all moms and babies, a cause Marcia and I care about deeply. We had a wonderful evening at their gala last night, joining hundreds of others in a bipartisan, bicameral effort to raise awareness and support for maternal and infant health through research, education and advocacy.\n\nMarcia and I have participated in this event for over 10 years, and this year, we were honored to be recognized as \u201cLegacy Chefs.\u201d\n\nWe shared our \u201cScrumptious Peach Crisp\u201d recipe at our booth and had a great time connecting with everyone who stopped by, we even won the \u201cEasiest to Prepare Award!\u201d Thank you, @SenKatieBritt, for presenting us with this award.",
                "text_lang": "en",
