                "text": "Earlier this week, I had a great day at @OhioState's Wexner Medical Center seeing the new hospital tower and touring the James Cancer Center. The technology there is truly out of this world! It\u2019s remarkable to see how OSU is expanding to meet the needs of the community. Ended the day at the Nuclear Reactor Research Laboratory, where students get hands-on experience with advanced nuclear technology that\u2019s driving innovation across fields.",
